1
00:00:00,510 --> 00:00:02,837
But this power
of discernment was denied them,

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:05,277
and only in after years,
with the loved ones

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:09,270
of their own firesides close about them,
was the whole picture revealed.

4
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:13,127
One dark night,
at the head of a score of his tribe,

5
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:17,780
he fell upon Wabigoon's camp, his object
being the abduction of the princess.

6
00:00:18,725 --> 00:00:22,525
While the attack was successful
in a way, its main purpose failed.
